{"id": "regents-water-overbilling-credit", "title": "The university overbilling case that San Francisco settled with a water credit", "seconds": 42.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "6fe753da5e4880d7", "words": 115, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The University of California sued San Francisco over a utility bill.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.35, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["A", "university", "billing", "dispute"], "sub": "The university sued over utility overbilling"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.63, 0.72, 1.46, 1.79, 2.04, 2.79, 3.08, 3.22, 3.8]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The City authorized a credit of more than $473,000.", "t0": 4.47, "t1": 9.05, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "case", "layout": "table", "heading": "Refund terms", "context": "Ordinance 041-17", "rows": [{"label": "Refund", "value": "$473,530.02"}, {"label": "Credit", "value": "Future water charges"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.48, 1.04, 1.11, 1.5, 1.63, 1.84, 2.05, 2.34, 2.75, 3.45, 3.92]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In December 2016, the utilities commission discussed the case behind closed doors.", "t0": 9.27, "t1": 14.31, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "minutes", "kicker": "The commission announced the settlement in open session", "text": "Settlement discussion", "mark": "Settlement"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.66, 0.97, 1.57, 1.7, 2.27, 2.72, 3.2, 3.31, 3.65, 4.06, 4.43]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Back in open session, the commission president announced a settlement.", "t0": 14.43, "t1": 17.92, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "minutes", "kicker": "The commission announced the settlement in open session", "text": "Public announcement", "mark": "Public"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.43, 0.75, 1.2, 1.3, 1.71, 2.18, 2.68, 2.78]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The Board voted 11 to zero twice.", "t0": 18.04, "t1": 20.21, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "votes", "layout": "table", "heading": "Board of Supervisors", "context": "Recorded votes in 2017", "rows": [{"label": "January 31", "value": "11–0"}, {"label": "February 7", "value": "11–0"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.43, 0.76, 1.14, 1.24, 1.61]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The refund would come off future water bills.", "t0": 20.33, "t1": 22.67, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "case", "kicker": "The Board authorized a credit on future water bills", "text": "Credit against future charges", "mark": "Credit"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.56, 0.72, 0.93, 1.14, 1.53, 1.86]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The utility reported $1.534 million in university water revenue that fiscal year.", "t0": 22.89, "t1": 28.8, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "customer", "layout": "table", "heading": "UCSF water revenue", "context": "Retail water revenue", "rows": [{"label": "2016", "value": "$1.435m"}, {"label": "2017", "value": "$1.534m"}, {"label": "2018", "value": "$1.689m"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.67, 1.13, 1.36, 1.68, 2.03, 2.34, 2.64, 3.04, 3.45, 3.57, 4.14, 4.46, 4.86, 5.06, 5.52]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Sewer charges appeared on a separate line.", "t0": 28.92, "t1": 31.21, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "customer", "kicker": "Annual customer revenue does not show when the credit posted", "text": "Separate services", "mark": "Separate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.42, 0.87, 1.27, 1.38, 1.47, 1.85]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Annual totals cannot tell us when that credit posted.", "t0": 31.33, "t1": 34.41, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "When did the credit post?"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.91, 1.27, 1.53, 1.68, 1.91, 2.11, 2.45]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The credit memo and the adjusted invoices would answer that question.", "t0": 34.53, "t1": 38.38, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The missing credit memo"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.47, 0.9, 1.06, 1.16, 1.7, 2.38, 2.6, 2.97, 3.19]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 38.5, "t1": 41.11, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.41, 0.8, 0.97, 1.29, 1.39, 1.48, 1.78, 2.11]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "The university sued over utility overbilling", "b": "The commission announced the settlement in open session", "o": "Annual customer revenue does not show when the credit posted"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document"}